<div class="space-y-6">
  <div>
    <h2 class="headline-md text-ink">Import / export</h2>
    <p class="mt-1 text-ink-muted">Bring your bookmarks in from other services, or take them with you.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="callout callout-warn">
    <span class="badge badge-ai mt-0.5">Beta</span>
    <p>During beta, export your data regularly as a backup. Data may be lost during updates.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card p-6">
    <h3 class="title">Export your data</h3>
    <p class="mt-1 mb-5 text-ink-muted">Download every bookmark with its tags, dates, and notes in a portable format.</p>
    <form action="/users/export" method="post">
      {{csrfField}}
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Export data</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <div class="card p-6">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <img src="/assets/icons/pocket.png" alt="" class="size-10 shrink-0" />
      <div>
        <h3 class="title">Import from Pocket</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 mb-5 text-ink-muted">Move all your saved articles from Pocket into your library.</p>
        <a href="/users/pocket-import" class="btn btn-secondary">Import from Pocket</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
